<title>HONG KONG: HK Telecom interim net rises 12.1 pct.</title>
<headline>HK Telecom interim net rises 12.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   47.3     vs 43.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    34.6     vs 30.9</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    5,393.4  vs 4,812.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		     15,920.0 vs 14,565.7</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 25-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong Telecommunications engages in telecommunications, computer and engineering services.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
